{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45593","headline":"拟齐梁酬所知见赠二首 二 · 贯休","name":"拟齐梁酬所知见赠二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美如仙鼎金，清如纤手琴。\n孙登啸一声，缥缈不可寻。\n但觉神洋洋，如入三昧林。\n释手复在手，古意深复深。\n惭无英琼瑶，何以酬知音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45593.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45593","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}